# Committed test fixture, not a build artifact — the `dist/` name mirrors
# what a real `@fastify/static` root looks like (design D9, S3).
!packages/bff/src/main/__tests__/fixtures/dist/
!packages/bff/src/main/__tests__/fixtures/dist/**

# Tooling state: the skill registry is regenerated by `gentle-ai skill-registry
# refresh` and is machine-local — it lists absolute paths from the developer's
# home directory, so it is meaningless in anyone else's checkout.
.atl/

# Local CodeGraph index: a machine-local SQLite graph rebuilt from the checkout
# by `codegraph init`. Every worktree needs its own; sharing one is wrong.
.codegraph/
